diff --git a/RELEASE_V8.2.9.md b/RELEASE_V8.2.9.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..955fe87
--- /dev/null
+++ b/RELEASE_V8.2.9.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+V8.2.9 fixes the common history evidence path for every stock and makes the beginner report explicit about direction, long entry observations, long loss exits and short cover stops.
+
+Official TWSE MI_INDEX and TPEx dated daily quotes now provide the shared unadjusted OHLCV window. Each stock file is checked against a published SHA256 manifest and its per-session exchange evidence. Older non-trading interruptions remain in the original receipt; only the latest continuous positive-volume window is used, with at least 63 sessions needed for a complete trend plan. No missing candles are invented.
+
+The official session calendar is independent of revisions to a same-date quote snapshot. Failed loads are retried, published months and actual sessions remain checked, and a calendar never extends beyond its published dates. Research uses a single declared official volume source; differing market snapshot totals are retained for comparison rather than mixed into the series.
+
+The five-section mobile report separates observed direction, the bullish watch/entry range, the long stop and first reduction reference, the bearish break/short stop, and what to do after opening. Short calculations disclose unverified borrow eligibility and omitted borrowing cost. No failed risk test or unavailable data becomes a confirmed entry.
+
+Every stock in the completed-date universe is recomputed with legal-tick and opposite-stop-geometry checks. Mobile tests cover real official histories, FULL service resource failure recovery, the opening calculator, one-page summaries and consistent filter adapters. The daily update workflow refreshes the same official history and audit automatically.
